{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Mayhem is a 2D action and casual game featuring roguelite elements, where you select a character to battle through waves of enemies. Upgrade your arsenal by purchasing new weapons and equipment from the mysterious vending machine while leveling up your character along the way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/c7cf6aa1110b0559e27e139537ad33c2.poster.avif?t=1755799980\" width=800 height=133 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/c7cf6aa1110b0559e27e139537ad33c2.webm?t=1755799980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies, robots, and other menaces in intense battles as you unlock upgrades and unique characters. Each character comes with an exclusive passive ability and distinct stats to match your gameplay style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/3bd22630483bd55926e71f3dfdde34f5.poster.avif?t=1755799980\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/3bd22630483bd55926e71f3dfdde34f5.webm?t=1755799980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/3bd22630483bd55926e71f3dfdde34f5.mp4?t=1755799980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 items to create your build; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different maps; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different enemies and 6 bosses;</p></li><li><p